ob starts emitting stamps.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation hotkeys read and write stamps[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-stamp[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-stamp: teach the lane-walk chip to read and show stamps, then stamp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every bob-navigation-hotkeys Work Log writer and preview from one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit-time clock read per gesture.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture close stamps entries and owns the grammar docs[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-stamp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-strip, nav-stamp[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-stamp: stamp capture `x` close entries from the close's own `now`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish the canonical entry grammar in vault-format.md, refresh the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture/plan/projects docs, and mark the JSON shape change with `!`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Unlink prompt and Pomodoro checkbox close write stamps[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler-stamp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-stamp[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler-stamp: stamp block-id-prompt's unlink Work Log and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task-status-cycler's Pomodoro close entries from one commit-time clock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read, replacing the daily-note-filename date.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-fd","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-fd.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e3cae2629eb16a1e8091dcf7ff74783d","started_at":"2026-11-01T20:31:09.232672+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd.4","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-fd.land"]}
